.TH SOCKETLEY 1 "2026" "socketley" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
socketley \- manage network runtimes (servers, clients, proxies, Redis-compatible caches) in Docker-like style
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B socketley
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B socketley
.B daemon
